==English==
===Etymology===
[[w:Galvani|Galvani]] + [[-ize]]. Galvani was the discoverer of the process.

===Pronunciation===
*{{IPA|/ˈgælvænaɪz/}}

===Alternative spellings===
* [[galvanise]] (''mostly UK'')

===Verb===
{{en-verb|galvaniz|ing}}

#{{transitive|chemistry}} To coat with a thin layer of [[metal]] by [[electrochemical]] means; to [[electroplate]].
#{{transitive}} To coat with rust-resistant [[zinc]]
#{{transitive}} To [[shock]] or [[stimulate]] into sudden activity

